  m_Name: place_atom_gen_context
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MobileIdleBuilder::MobileIdleBuilder.DialogueSO
  lines:
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: 'Place the Atom Generator on the glowing tiles. It draws 20 eV, and a generator
      only powers buildings inside its influence circle, so the glow marks a spot
      in range of your Basic Generator. It is two tiles wide with four intakes, and
      the glow leaves room for a belt at each one: hydrogen needs protons and electrons
      now, and helium will need neutrons too.'
